{"cluster": 5, "band": "2-3", "size": 3, "label": "", "member_ids": ["FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-11965", "FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-18972", "FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-23145"], "members": ["We should be protecting the naturally beautiful and generous planet we live on. What an unfortunate future for our grandchildren if we limit the protections on endangered species. There will be many species who no longer exist except in captivity. I hope every person gets to experience seeing a massive bald eagle flying and catching a fish in a river, including my future grandchildren. As a strong supporter of wildlife and the Endangered Species Act, I urge you to abandon your three major proposed changes for implementing the Act. These proposals would drastically undermine the Act and set us ", "As a teacher and parent, I want my future grandchildren and great grandchildren to have a planet where all species thrive while co-existing. I am quite sure that living things are more important to our mental health and the physical health of the planet than corporations and hunters of those same beings. Its time to expand our protection, not diminish it.. As a strong supporter of wildlife and the Endangered Species Act, I urge you to abandon your three major proposed changes for implementing the Endangered Species Act. These proposals would drastically undermine the Act and set us in exactly ", "The Endangered Species Act has help many species to stabilize and even recover, and business has made unprecedented profits in the meantime and are now sitting on record amounts of cash. We can protect our environment and still make plenty of money. Let's not be foolish and short-sighted about this. Protect our children's natural heritage now and in the future. Support the Endangered Species Act! As a strong supporter of wildlife and the Endangered Species Act, I urge you to abandon your three major proposed changes for implementing the Act. These proposals would drastically undermine the Act "]}
