{"cluster": 11, "band": "4-10", "size": 8, "label": "", "member_ids": ["FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-54369", "FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-54527", "FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-54631"], "members": ["care deeply about our countrys wildlife, and I oppose the proposed changes to weaken the Endangered Species Act (ESA). The ESA dramatically improves the lives of threatened and endangered species in the wild, and helps protect the individual captive animals who desperately need help. I urge the government to withdraw this misguided plan and strengthen, not weaken, the Endangered Species Act.", "I care deeply about our countrys wildlife, and I oppose the proposed changes to weaken the Endangered Species Act (ESA). The ESA dramatically improves the lives of threatened and endangered species in the wild, and helps protect the individual captive animals who desperately need help. I urge the government to withdraw this misguided plan and strengthen, not weaken, the Endangered Species Act.", "I care deeply about our countrys wildlife, and I oppose the proposed changes to weaken the Endangered Species Act (ESA). The ESA dramatically improves the lives of threatened and endangered species in the wild, and helps protect the individual captive animals who desperately need help. I urge the government to withdraw this misguided plan and strengthen, not weaken, the Endangered Species Act."]}
