{"cluster": 22, "band": "51-500", "size": 71, "label": "", "member_ids": ["FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-30057", "FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-30156", "FWS-HQ-ES-2018-0006-30291"], "members": ["Anybody who has ever been in a new car showroom understands what sticker shock is. It happens when you are surprised by the price of the new car you want. With the Obama mileage standards, we are guaranteeing a nationwide outbreak of sticker shock. A price hike of $3,000 for a new car will force buyers off the showroom floor. It will discourage most people form buying the new car they want. Lets fix these standards and help the domestic auto industry. Regards, Denise Terrell", "Anybody who has ever been in a new car showroom understands what sticker shock is. It happens when you are surprised by the price of the new car you want. With the Obama mileage standards, we are guaranteeing a nationwide outbreak of sticker shock. A price hike of $3,000 for a new car will force buyers off the showroom floor. It will discourage most people form buying the new car they want. Lets fix these standards and help the domestic auto industry. Regards, Sandra Medlin", "Anybody who has ever been in a new car showroom understands what sticker shock is. It happens when you are surprised by the price of the new car you want. With the Obama mileage standards, we are guaranteeing a nationwide outbreak of sticker shock. A price hike of $3,000 for a new car will force buyers off the showroom floor. It will discourage most people form buying the new car they want. Lets fix these standards and help the domestic auto industry. Regards, Bronson Thomas"]}
